'''Crazed Cats''' are all [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] based on the nine [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] that you earn at the start of the game. Although they retain a striking resemblance to Normal Cats, they are far more powerful, some analysis of just how much more powerful can be found [[Crazed Cats (origin)|here]].

The list of Crazed Cats includes:
*[[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] → Crazed Macho Cat → Manic Mohawk Cat (''Complete [[Deathhawk (Deadly)|Cat Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank Cat]] → Crazed Wall Cat → Manic Eraser Cat (''Complete [[Vulcanizer (Deadly)|Tank Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Axe Cat]] → Crazed Brave Cat → Manic Dark Cat (''Complete [[Unjust War (Deadly)|Axe Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]] → Crazed Sexy Legs Cat → Manic Macho Legs (''Complete [[Muscle Party (Deadly)|Gross Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] → Crazed Giraffe Cat → Manic Lion Cat (''Complete [[Lots O' Lion (Deadly)|Cow Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Bird Cat]] → Crazed UFO Cat → Manic Flying Cat (''Complete [[Forest Beasts (Deadly)|Bird Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish Cat]] → Crazed Whale Cat → Manic Island Cat (''Complete [[Ogre Island (Deadly)|Fish Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Lizard Cat]] → Crazed Dragon Cat → Manic King Dragon (''Complete [[Draconian (Deadly)|Lizard Maniac]] for True Form'')
*[[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]] → Crazed Mythical Titan Cat → Manic Jameira Cat (''Complete [[Resident Feline (Deadly)|Titan Maniac]] for True Form'')

